## Scope

This licence covers the analysis code, the analysis plan, and the written
reports in this repository.

It does NOT cover `data/raw/cookie_cats.csv`. That dataset is redistributed
here for reproducibility and is not the author's work. It is the Cookie Cats
A/B test dataset originally distributed by DataCamp and widely mirrored; the
author makes no ownership claim over it and asserts no licence on it. See
`data/PROVENANCE.md` for its source and integrity record. If you are the
rights holder and want it removed, open an issue.
